  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Commercial Agriculture for Smallholders and Agribusiness</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Commercial Agriculture for Smallholders and Agribusiness (CASA) programme supports small and medium-sized (SME) agribusinesses with smallholder supply chains to grow and attract investment for high development impact. CASA is 100% International Climate Finance (ICF) funded, building inclusive, climate-resilient agri-food systems that increase smallholder farmer incomes and strengthen food production, food security and nutrition outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
